{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与演进篇导读","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"restaking-mechanisms","title":"再质押机制与安全性经济学","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/restaking-mechanisms","wordCount":1250,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"governance-and-dao","title":"治理与 DAO 设计","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/governance-and-dao","wordCount":1376,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-chain-defi","title":"跨链 DeFi 与流动性统一","url":"/h/economics-finance/defi-protocol-design/operations/cross-chain-defi","wordCount":1316,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 运营与演进篇导读\n\n协议设计不止于部署——如何升级、如何治理、如何跨链扩展、如何通过再质押叠加安全性，都是协议长期演进的关键决策。本章覆盖再质押机制的经济学模型、DAO 治理的投票博弈与委托设计、以及跨链 DeFi 的流动性统一策略。这些主题连接了协议的「设计态」与「运行态」。\n"}